WEBVTT

00:11:28.459 --> 00:11:33.037
and now he plays soccer with me
in a more coordinated manner.

00:11:33.667 --> 00:11:38.009
This has left my wife's heart
and mine melting,

00:11:38.033 --> 00:11:40.315
and we've been blown away

00:11:40.339 --> 00:11:43.015
by the unbelievable results
we've witnessed

00:11:43.039 --> 00:11:46.289
as a result of this
experimental methodology.

00:11:46.313 --> 00:11:50.271
And now, we proudly
call ourselves "agile parents."

00:11:52.152 --> 00:11:56.168
You may be a parent
with a special needs child like me,

00:11:57.225 --> 00:12:01.905
or you could be facing different types
of limitation in your life: